        366.7755126953125
      ],
      "text": "No study provided a comparison with 6 months of isoniazid. Although the trial was conducted in low TB incidence countries, this is unlikely to affect the relative effect of RPT/isoniazid as compared with isoniazid monotherapy.  a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
