        366.1755065917969,
        150.61636352539062,
        375.7755126953125
      ],
      "text": "Downgraded by one level.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        372.1755065917969,
        629.73583984375,
        384.7755126953125
      ],
      "text": "Although the 95% CI of the RR is wide, there were few events, and the CI of the absolute effect is narrow. The result also met pre-stated non-inferiority margin. Not downgraded.  b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
