        381.1755065917969,
        457.7848815917969,
        393.7755126953125
      ],
      "text": "Although the 95% CI of the RR is wide, there were few events, and the CI of the absolute effect is narrow. Not downgraded.  c",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
